WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
Or use it to entertain guests

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,280
Definitely impressive

3
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:05,020
This Gao Yang is very rare, right?

4
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:06,740
What are you and I talking about?

5
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:09,000
It’s just that you’ve always been high-minded, brother

6
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,760
How's the business at your convenience store lately?

7
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:12,480
Those wine and tea last time

8
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:15,440
It's really not like the goods you can get in ordinary small stores.

9
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:16,640
Sell if the goods are suitable

10
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:18,280
Shopkeepers have to be serious about their business

11
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:19,920
You have quite a broad path

12
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:21,560
My family used to do this business too

13
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:23,120
My parents own a supermarket

14
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:24,680
I guess I’ve been exposed to these since childhood.

15
00:00:31,290 --> 00:00:32,490
Then Brother Wang, I will leave first.

16
00:00:32,610 --> 00:00:33,890
Don’t give it to me if it’s cold weather.

17
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:35,570
Okay, slow down on the road
